stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> PENDING: planner creates job for a SEALED partition
  PENDING --> COPYING: runner picks job, attempt + 1
  COPYING --> VERIFYING: copy done, manifest written last
  VERIFYING --> SWITCHING: count and fingerprint match
  SWITCHING --> PURGE_PENDING: catalog switched in one transaction
  PURGE_PENDING --> DONE: grace period over, old copy deleted
  COPYING --> ROLLING_BACK: error
  VERIFYING --> ROLLING_BACK: mismatch
  ROLLING_BACK --> PENDING: attempts left, backoff
  ROLLING_BACK --> FAILED: no attempts left, alert
  DONE --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]

  note right of COPYING
    Catalog still points at the source.
    Searches are unaffected.
    After a crash, the restarted dlm
    resumes from the saved status.
  end note
  note right of PURGE_PENDING
    Grace period is longer than the query timeout,
    so running queries on the old copy finish safely.
  end note
